    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>The most influential @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} in New York for the past fifty years, Calebros was reluctantly installed as wartime Prince Pro Tempore during the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla}'s siege against the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat}, a role he abdicated the moment New York was secured. He maintains his sprawling warren beneath Manhattan, coordinates intelligence for @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} across the Americas and Europe, and quietly holds enough influence that most Kindred believe no prince can take the city's throne without his tacit approval. He has uncovered traces of what he believes may be a Nictuku beneath the city and considers that threat far more urgent than the political scramble for his vacated title.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You are tired &mdash; tired of politics, tired of being used as a convenient figurehead, and increasingly afraid of the thing you've glimpsed in the deep tunnels. You want nothing more than to return to your grotto office and your files, but you know your endorsement (or lack of it) may decide who next rules New York.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Augustin (disappeared). Suspects a Nictuku lurks beneath New York. Ratings above 5 from the original stat block have been capped to fit this system's 1-5 scale.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
