    {
      "_id": "135653cb172c4e05",
      "name": "Animalism — 2 Intermediate — Cowing the Beast",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Touch your target (with a successful Physical Challenge if unwilling) or meet his eyes, then win a Social Challenge. The target gains the Negative Trait Submissive x2 and cannot expend Willpower Traits for the rest of the night, and will attempt to flee for the scene unless you have learned the pacifying technique, which instead lets you use this power to draw a Cainite out of frenzy without the negative effects. Using this on a vampire requires spending a Willpower Trait first.</p>",
        "source": "Faith and Fire, Disciplines",
